# Copy to .env and edit. .env is gitignored; this template is not.
#
# For local development this one line is the whole setup. Everything else here
# is optional, and without any of it the game still runs, just without art.

# Where an unzipped Tiny Swords pack lives on this machine.
# `pnpm assets` links it into apps/web/public/tiny-swords.
TINY_SWORDS_PATH=/absolute/path/to/unzipped/tiny-swords

# A zip to download instead. Set this in your host's environment when you
# deploy, not here: a signed URL expires, so one written into a file works for
# a few minutes and then fails a deploy with nothing obvious to point at.
# TINY_SWORDS_URL=https://your-bucket/tiny-swords.zip

# Prefix every pack request gets. Default /tiny-swords, which suits a host
# serving the app from the root. A Discord Activity is proxied, so it needs:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_BASE=/.proxy/tiny-swords
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_BASE=/tiny-swords
